1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,860
In the hardest rooms I've sat in, I found out that laughter's free

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:12,580
It's a medicine they don't sell, and it worked the best on me

3
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:19,780
If you can laugh through the cancer, laugh through the hurting and the grief

4
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,000
You steal the power from the dark and turn the devil into a thief
